Archive Manager includes Junrar 8.1.0 for read-only RAR handling.

The build replaces Junrar's ArchiveOptions and Rar5Crypt classes with source-derived variants.
ArchiveOptions clears builder and options password arrays as soon as their copies have been
transferred. Rar5Crypt disables Junrar's JVM-global RAR5 key-derivation cache so passwords and
derived keys do not remain reachable across archive sessions. These modifications do not implement
compression. Under the UnRAR license, neither these modifications nor the bundled reader code may
be used to develop a RAR (WinRAR) compatible archiver.
